#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:5
msgid "Bind slave item"
msgstr "捆绑奴隶物品"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:7
msgid ""
"It can happen that one device should be represented in the `project`_ using "
"different `elements`_, power and control subsystem and auxiliary subsystems."
" All these `elements`_ should be considered as one device. QElectroTech "
"works with `master`_ and `slave`_ elements which are linked using `cross "
"references`_ to represent the device."
msgstr ""
"可能发生的情况是，一个设备应该使用不同的 `项目 <project_>`_，功率和控制子系统和辅助子系统在 `元件 <elements_>`_ "
"中被表示，所有这些 `元件 <elements_>`_ 都应被视为一个设备。QElectroTech与 `master <master_>`_ 和 "
"`slave <slave_>`_ 元素一起工作，这些元素是用 `交叉引用 <cross references_>`_ 连接来表示设备的。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:12
msgid ""
"A `slave element`_ can be linked to a `master element`_ with the following "
"steps:"
msgstr "a `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_ 可链接到一个 `主元件 <master element_>`_，步骤如下："

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:14
msgid ""
"Select the `master element`_ which should be linked from the `project "
"collection`_ or from the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"选择 `主元件 <master element_>`_，该元件应从 `元件集合 <project collection_>`_ 或 `工作区 "
"<workspace_>`_ 链接。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:15
msgid ""
"Right click on the selected `element`_ and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键点击选中的 `元件 <element_>`_ 并选择选项 **编辑元素** 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Display`_ the **Cross-reference (Master)** tab from the element editor "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 元素编辑器 PopUP 窗口的 **Cross-Reference (Master)** tab."

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:27
#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:43
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cross reference tab element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 交叉引用标签元素属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:29
msgid ""
"Search and select the desired `slave element`_ from the **Available "
"elements** table."
msgstr "搜索并从 **可用元素** 表中选择想要的 `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:30
msgid ""
"Press **Bind item** |icon_bind| to link the `slave element`_ to the `master "
"element`_."
msgstr ""
"按 **Bind 项** |icon_bind| 将 `奴隶元素 <slave element_>`_ 与 `主元件 <master "
"element_>`_ 链接。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:33
msgid "icon_bind"
msgstr "图标( B)"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:31
msgid "Press **Apply** to accept and save the changes."
msgstr "按 **Apply** 接受并保存更改。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/master_item_bind.rst:37
msgid ""
"At the available elements table, the `slave element`_ can also be linked by "
"right click on the `element`_ and selecting the option **Link the item**."
msgstr ""
"在现有的元素表中，`slave元素 <slave element_>`_ 也可以通过右键点击 `元件 <element_>`_ 并选择选项 "
"**链接项目** 而链接。"
